    "title": "Midnight ZKIR Forge \u2014 initial HTTP subset",
    "version": "0.2.0",
    "description": "Single-owner service. Raw single-circuit uploads and synchronous materialization. No archives, durable jobs, namespaces, HTTP provider views or hosted registry guarantees. Bearer authentication is enforced when a token file is configured and required for non-loopback binding. No CORS; TLS belongs at a trusted reverse proxy. Parameter acquisition is an explicit operator option."
